{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Raccoon with Attitude</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randy isn\u2019t just your average raccoon\u2014he\u2019s got opinions, and he\u2019s not afraid to share them! Run into a wall? He\u2019ll yell \u201cOw!\u201d Take a dive? He\u2019ll blame you for getting him wet. Every crash, stunt, and silly moment comes with Randy\u2019s signature commentary and expressive reactions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187000/extras/bd5a364d11e2200d29ccea020f105d2e.poster.avif?t=1764598997\" width=790 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187000/extras/bd5a364d11e2200d29ccea020f105d2e.webm?t=1764598997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187000/extras/bd5a364d11e2200d29ccea020f105d2e.mp4?t=1764598997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>A Vibrant, Open World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a sprawling island filled with colorful NPCs to meet and missions to complete. From sassy animals to the infamous goose gang, there's something around every corner.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187000/extras/ca3cae34477145891ac70826116bcc0f.poster.avif?t=1764598997\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187000/extras/ca3cae34477145891ac70826116bcc0f.webm?t=1764598997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187000/extras/ca3cae34477145891ac70826116bcc0f.mp4?t=1764598997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Super Car</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The car you drive around in isn't just a boring driving car, it's got tons of fun features! Don't just drive around, use your rocket engine to fly around, use your jump to...well jump. Let's just say you're not stuck to the ground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187000/extras/fa414cc8c0decf3717a7932db3f7922a.poster.avif?t=1764598997\" width=1170 height=582 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187000/extras/fa414cc8c0decf3717a7932db3f7922a.webm?t=1764598997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187000/extras/fa414cc8c0decf3717a7932db3f7922a.mp4?t=1764598997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A ton of crazy weapons like a balloon gun, stink tornados &amp; a radio that attracts humans like mosquitos to light.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lot of humans walking to test your weapons on or just hit &amp; run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Funny animals to talk to and accept missions from like Crazy Coq, Chip the Mechanic, a Cult Leader Capybara &amp; more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive map, the map has been filled with interaction such as cliffs with a certain weight limit, a big catapult, snowballs you can roll to grow, and more. In combination with your weapons you can create any situation to torture NPCs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Storyline, take down goose gang who have terrorized the island since you left.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Side Challenges, aside from the main storyline there's side challenges for you to complete &amp; cosmetics to unlock. Test your skills in these challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectibles, there's trash bags spread around the island, collect them all &amp; unlock a surprise!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3187000?t=1764598997","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3187000?t=1764598997","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187000/53b9bcc74b1305116f5a6fd012528bdd8081dbf6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764598997","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187000/53b9bcc74b1305116f5a6fd012528bdd8081dbf6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764598997","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3425080,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Raccoon with Attitude</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randy isn\u2019t just your average raccoon\u2014he\u2019s got opinions, and he\u2019s not afraid to share them! Run into a wall? He\u2019ll yell \u201cOw!\u201d Take a dive? He\u2019ll blame you for getting him wet. Every crash, stunt, and silly moment comes with Randy\u2019s signature commentary and expressive reactions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187000/extras/bd5a364d11e2200d29ccea020f105d2e.poster.avif?t=1764598997\" width=790 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187000/extras/bd5a364d11e2200d29ccea020f105d2e.webm?t=1764598997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187000/extras/bd5a364d11e2200d29ccea020f105d2e.mp4?t=1764598997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>A Vibrant, Open World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a sprawling island filled with colorful NPCs to meet and missions to complete. From sassy animals to the infamous goose gang, there's something around every corner.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187000/extras/ca3cae34477145891ac70826116bcc0f.poster.avif?t=1764598997\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187000/extras/ca3cae34477145891ac70826116bcc0f.webm?t=1764598997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187000/extras/ca3cae34477145891ac70826116bcc0f.mp4?t=1764598997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Super Car</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The car you drive around in isn't just a boring driving car, it's got tons of fun features! Don't just drive around, use your rocket engine to fly around, use your jump to...well jump. Let's just say you're not stuck to the ground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187000/extras/fa414cc8c0decf3717a7932db3f7922a.poster.avif?t=1764598997\" width=1170 height=582 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187000/extras/fa414cc8c0decf3717a7932db3f7922a.webm?t=1764598997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187000/extras/fa414cc8c0decf3717a7932db3f7922a.mp4?t=1764598997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A ton of crazy weapons like a balloon gun, stink tornados &amp; a radio that attracts humans like mosquitos to light.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lot of humans walking to test your weapons on or just hit &amp; run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Funny animals to talk to and accept missions from like Crazy Coq, Chip the Mechanic, a Cult Leader Capybara &amp; more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive map, the map has been filled with interaction such as cliffs with a certain weight limit, a big catapult, snowballs you can roll to grow, and more. In combination with your weapons you can create any situation to torture NPCs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Storyline, take down goose gang who have terrorized the island since you left.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Side Challenges, aside from the main storyline there's side challenges for you to complete &amp; cosmetics to unlock. Test your skills in these challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectibles, there's trash bags spread around the island, collect them all &amp; unlock a surprise!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["slobbymonk"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/ap